  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gweru Additional Fertiliser Project - Livelihoods Promotion and Protection Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at complimenting the Emergency Food Security programme in four wards of Chivundura communal areas, Gweru District in Midlands Province of Zimbabwe. The EFSP will be providing food support to the beneficiaries in the selected wards of the district and this project will ensure that the households that receive food will be able to produce enough food to feed themselves in 2009. Soil fertility being the most limiting factor to crop production besides water, it is important that fertiliser be distributed to the food beneficiaries so that they can improve food production at household level for the coming year.</narrative>
  </description>
